  "raw_request": "In lib/serializer.js, make Serializer.asNumber() throw a number conversion error for an empty string or a string containing only whitespace instead of returning 0. Keep the behavior for numeric 0, string \"0\", and valid numeric strings. Add node:test cases in test/asNumber.test.js.",
